Praski et al. (2025), "Benchmarking pretrained molecular embedding models for
molecular representation learning". It was copied at upstream commit 17d2aa1
and then modified (see VENDORED.md).

The upstream project states: "Feel free to use any parts of this project in
your research. If you do so, please cite our paper as shown above. Due to the
vast number of models used in this project, we're unable to provide a unified
license for the entire repository. Please refer to the individual model
