The upstream repository therefore offers no open-source licence. This
directory is included under that research-use permission only. The MIT
licence in the repository root does not apply to it, and no licence is granted
here for redistribution or reuse of the upstream code. If you use it, cite the
paper above and check the licences of the individual model implementations.
